FINDINGS (Security R1). noInstallLanding diffs only head.sha^..head.sha, the card's LAST commit. A card whose earlier commit changes worker/ (or migrations, collector, gate, page, hooks) and whose tip is a docs- or tests-only fix-up (a CHANGELOG or DECISIONS blank-line commit, as on product #C860 v2 ee063c3) lands, reads Live with noInstall, and is never dispatched to 'pair': a signed Worker change, a security fix included, sits undeployed while the board says live. Tests cover single-commit cards only. Fix: judge the whole undeployed range, e.g. every path in git diff --name-only <repo.live>..<head.sha> matches DOCS_ONLY (no repo.live: false, keep waiting), or the union over all the card's commits since main; add a test with a worker/ commit under a docs-only tip.
